An image was untagged or removed from the store of a container engine of the node.

Published by the container monitor when the event stream of podman or docker tells an image untag, delete or remove, as an image rm or an image prune causes: type is the driver type of the resources of the engine, as container.podman, and store the store of the engine, empty for the one of the system, the only one watched. name and id are the image as the engine tells it: docker tells the id alone, podman a name when it has one. Both are empty when the event stream started, or started again, and removals may have been missed. The image prefetch checks the images the node is meant to hold, and pulls the missing ones again.
